  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Chop carrot and potato into small chunks.\n• Slice red onion into thick wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/627cbaa121b241fb620fb8a9/step-9e845012.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place prepped veggies on a lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and pepper and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the veggies between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/627cbaa121b241fb620fb8a9/step-71ad375f.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, combine caesar dressing, mayonnaise and most of the grated Parmesan cheese (save a pinch for garnish!) in a small bowl.\n• Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/627cbaa121b241fb620fb8a9/step-a6031702.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the veggies have 10 minutes remaining, combine garlic & herb seasoning and a drizzle of olive oil in a medium bowl. Add plant-based crumbed chicken. Gently turn to coat.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a generous drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook plant-based chicken until just browned, 2-3 minutes each side.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/627cbaa121b241fb620fb8a9/step-3c6d582b.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, slice tomato into wedges.\n• In a second medium bowl, combine a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season, then add tomato and mixed salad leaves.\n• Toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/627cbaa121b241fb620fb8a9/step-2e7023af.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide garlicky chicken, roast veggies and salad between plates.\n• Drizzle caesar-style sauce over chicken and salad.\n• Sprinkle walnuts and reserved Parmesan over salad to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/627cbaa121b241fb620fb8a9/step-265bfdc9.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
